            "heading": "Padma  Pure Copper Water Bottle, 1 Litre",
            "content": "<p>Padma is a 1-litre pure copper water bottle from the Social India Craft Mandala Collection, featuring copper-toned lotus and mandala-inspired geometric artwork against a glossy black background. Its sophisticated design brings together traditional copperware with contemporary Indian-inspired artistry.</p><ul><li><strong>Material:</strong> Pure Copper </li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 1 Litre </li><li><strong>Design:</strong> Black with copper-toned printed lotus and mandala artwork </li><li><strong>Finish:</strong> Glossy </li><li><strong>Closure:</strong> Screw cap with silicone/rubber sealing ring </li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 10 inches height × 3 inches diameter </li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> Approx 300 g </li><li><strong>Country of Origin:</strong> India </li><li><strong>Recommended Use:</strong> Preferably for regular drinking water only </li></ul><p><strong>Thoughtfully Designed</strong></p><p>Padma, meaning <em>lotus</em>, draws inspiration from the timeless lotus motif found in Indian art and cultural traditions. The artwork on the bottle was personally created by the founder, with genuine appreciation for the beauty and artistry of mandala design.</p><p>Copper vessels have traditionally been used for storing drinking water, and water stored in copper is associated with traditional wellness practices. This bottle is intended for normal drinking water and is<strong> </strong>not suitable for hot water, hot beverages, milk, juice, carbonated drinks, acidic beverages, or other liquids.</p><p>Each bottle comes with a <strong>Copper Purity Certificate, and Thank You Card. </strong></p><p><strong>THE STORY OF PADMA</strong></p><p>Padma, meaning <em>lotus</em>, draws inspiration from one of the most recognizable motifs in Indian art and cultural traditions.</p><p>Its black finish creates a bold and elegant background for the lotus and mandala-inspired artwork, giving the bottle a sophisticated appearance.</p><p>Padma represents the meeting of traditional inspiration and contemporary presentation, making it a meaningful addition to the Mandala Collection.</p><p>Padma — Inspired by the timeless beauty of the lotus.</p><p><strong>CARE</strong></p><ul><li>Hand wash regularly using a method suitable for copper utensils. </li><li>Use gentle cleaning materials and avoid steel wool, abrasive scrubbers, and harsh cleaning products. </li><li>Wipe the printed exterior gently with a soft, damp cloth. </li><li>Copper may naturally develop oxidation or patina over time, which is a normal characteristic of the material. </li><li>Keep clean and dry when not in use. </li></ul><p><strong>Please note: </strong>The actual product may appear slightly darker in shade than it does in the product images.</p>",
